# GroqCloud: Whisper for STT and Orpheus for TTS, as in docker-compose.groq.yml. Paid, with a free tier whose rate
# limits a run of several replies at once can meet. Orpheus takes short inputs, so replies go sentence by sentence.
# Key: HA_LIVE_STT_KEY and HA_LIVE_TTS_KEY, a Groq API key.
# Serves: STT over HTTP, not streamed; TTS over HTTP, sentence by sentence.
# Backend: OPENAI for both.
STT_OPENAI_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
STT_MODELS=whisper-large-v3
STT_STREAMING_MODELS=
STT_REALTIME_MODELS=
STT_BACKEND=OPENAI
TTS_OPENAI_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
TTS_MODELS=canopylabs/orpheus-v1-english
TTS_STREAMING_MODELS=canopylabs/orpheus-v1-english
TTS_REALTIME_MODELS=
TTS_BACKEND=OPENAI
TTS_VOICES=autumn diana hannah austin daniel troy
